 - Booking errors are now `BookingError` subclasses (`SlotTaken`, `OutsideOpeningHours`) with receptionist-facing messages, instead of `ValueError`.
 - Each therapist needs a 10-minute gap before and after every appointment (`schedule.BUFFER`).
 - Fixed overlap check missing appointments that start before an existing one and run into it.
+- `Schedule.is_fully_booked(therapist, day)` for greying out days on the online booking page. True when no treatment fits on the day, including closed days.
 - Client register (`clients.Client`, `clients.ClientBook`). Phone lookup ignores formatting and matches `079…`, `+41…` and `0041…` notations of the same number.
 
